{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13224400","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322440001:1":{"text":"寒さ、飢え、貧困……この地に生まれ落ちた私たちは、真の幸福を手にしたことがありません！","source_cn":"我们生在这片土地上从来没有真正幸福过，寒冷，饥饿，贫穷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB9D342ECE3F8C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322440002:0":{"text":"私たちが苦しむさなか、デューラはどこにいたのか？本当に見てくれているのかと疑問に思ったことがあるでしょう。それは、デューラが私たちの神ではないからです！","source_cn":"我们受苦的时候艾雅在哪里？你是否跟我一样怀疑过艾雅从未...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF816A38AFC5C8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322440003:1":{"text":"偉大なる真の神に賛美あれ！俺たちを導いてくれるのは偉大なる意志だけだ！","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神，只有伟大意志才会指引我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C26530C87842B45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322440004:1":{"text":"偉大なる意志に賛美あれ！","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95674434202EEFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439001:":{"text":"自分が弱いと感じるのは……","source_cn":"你们感到虚弱","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ADAE30D80F645C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439002:":{"text":"あなたたちの肉体が平凡だからです！","source_cn":"因为你们是肉体凡躯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5771BDF45720833F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439003:":{"text":"偉大なる真の神を信じよ！","source_cn":"信仰伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x108880FC5F5E0FF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439004:":{"text":"魂を差し出すのです！","source_cn":"引渡我们的灵魂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561228FB3FEEBEE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322440005:1":{"text":"教主様、異端者を捕らえました。どういたしましょう？","source_cn":"引导者大人，我们抓到了一位异教徒，该如何处置？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71228625164ABA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322440006:1":{"text":"異端などと呼ぶべきではありません。彼らはただ、一時的に道を見失っているだけなのですよ。","source_cn":"别这样说，根本不存在什么异教徒，他们只是短暂的迷失了方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9598E659B398D020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322440007:1":{"text":"お嬢さん、私にお手伝いできることはありますか？","source_cn":"看着我，孩子，我能帮助你做些什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B6CAEB8F64971B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322440008:1":{"text":"あ……あたし……さ、探さ、ないと……","source_cn":"我……我……捉、找人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F201471EE1E323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322440009:1":{"text":"ちゃんと話せ！何を探してるって？妙なこと企んでないだろうな！？","source_cn":"你说什么？捉人？难道是来找事的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43902165FDD3C2E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322440010:1":{"text":"落ち着きなさい。言葉がうまく出ないだけでしょう。","source_cn":"冷静，她只是口齿不清罢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DEFCE758CF9D4F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322440011:1":{"text":"さ、探してる……れ、レフ……お兄ちゃん……","source_cn":"找……找列夫哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA790A1E245827B5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322440012:1":{"text":"レフ？レフさんを探しているのですね？そうか！あなたがイリーナ！","source_cn":"你的意思是，来找列夫的吗？哈！原来你就是伊琳娜是吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1B60AB47C534BC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322440013:1":{"text":"あ、あなた……し、知ってるの？","source_cn":"你认识……列夫哥哥？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49F021DF111A8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322440014:1":{"text":"もちろん、あの流浪の民ですよね？吟遊詩人だったか、旅の途中で足に凍傷を負ってしまい、それが原因で歩行困難に至ってしまったとか。","source_cn":"当然孩子，当然。列夫是个流浪汉，对吗？他原本是个吟游诗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD95C98568DCBFA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322440015:1":{"text":"それは慈悲深い方でした……初めて彼に会ったとき、彼はためらうことなくあなたの吃音を治してほしいと言ったのです。","source_cn":"真是个可怜人……我第一次见到他，还一位他的愿望是治好自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7472271CAEABED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1322440016:1":{"text":"レフ……お兄ちゃん……","source_cn":"列夫……哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24402C56A835FCF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1322440017:1":{"text":"自分の足のことを差し置いてですよ！偉大なる真の神は彼に応えました！彼は楽園に導かれたのです！","source_cn":"多么善良无私的人啊，伟大真神已经回应了列夫！将他带到了乐园！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93440C4BADDDD960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1322440018:1":{"text":"神父様、しかし彼女の吃音は治っていないようですが……","source_cn":"神父，但这女孩的口疾也没好不是吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41E1F8FA51F39E5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1322440019:1":{"text":"そうですよ。それに楽園とはどこなのです？","source_cn":"是啊，所以列夫去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729D7126B57A58B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1322440020:1":{"text":"迷える者よ……今あなたたちは奇跡の真っ只中にいるというのに、まだ気づかないのですか？","source_cn":"迷途的人啊……你们身在神迹中，却不知神迹已经发生着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67E78FD996CA9BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1322440021:1":{"text":"彼女がなぜここに現れたのか？すべては真の神の思し召し、偉大なる意志がここに連れてきたのです。彼女の吃音は、今回の祭祀とともに癒されるでしょう！","source_cn":"你们有没有想过她为什么会出现这？这一切都是伟大意志的调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE81ED3D8420A221B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1322440022:1":{"text":"偉大なる意志に賛美あれ！","source_cn":"赞美伟大意志！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D629139474B9343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen